  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_098933237a9e4c02b88752465f1f8b37",
      "statement": "Feature and ApplicationService are the framework's two public handler abstractions and share one abstract contract — execute(dto) returning a response DTO or None — but only ApplicationService is constructed with an execution handle: its first positional __init__ parameter is feature_bus: Bus, while Feature.__init__ takes only *args, **kwargs and merely prepares the context binder.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/__init__.py#L12-L21",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1b350901d5519f29458b7ad75e383992f4bd19b7f252fbc0b72ae6e655f5c19d:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/sincpro_abstractions.py#L141-L206",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:17482800943a99151cdccffadd5a6c2fc8cf1b6c2b4267e595621c3bf9097e8b:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/sincpro_abstractions.py#L85-L138",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:233694985540d9babd5b9f7d9c7d3f1800431f830c82e586df518c02e94efc83:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_030b90fe75d447fe959644e5b3ada4fa",
      "statement": "The IoC container instantiates an ApplicationService with the container's own feature_bus provider as a positional Factory argument, whereas a Feature entry is created with no positional argument at all — so orchestration is possible only for an ApplicationService, and the decorator stores providers rather than instantiating anything.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/ioc.py#L126-L147",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:468c60ccd7874d1fbd0ea58456ec462ae407c7ec1d3adc670e9c77399bde4270:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b4d3bfaa9420450c82e8a37afa632665",
      "statement": "The FeatureBus an ApplicationService receives is the same object the FrameworkBus facade holds: feature_bus is a Singleton provider fed to the framework_bus Factory and passed to each app-service Factory, and tests/observability/test_bus_wiring.py pins the identity app_service.feature_bus is framework.bus.feature_bus.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/ioc.py#L49-L66",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:76c8d4cbeab0e85a5ed437efa7a28ade6214566a9c6fb4cf51b0346ef1bca235:"
