    {
      "id": "claim_f57e26119312426488799eef7eccc821",
      "statement": "Layer membership is a registry membership keyed by the input DTO's class __name__ at both registration and lookup, never by the class object, so two distinct DTO classes sharing a __name__ collide within one layer and dispatch is unaffected by which generics the handler declared.",
