      "id": "claim_2502cae8525143b9a819c4b332b2914f",
      "statement": "return_type is a static-typing device only: the .pyi overloads narrow the declared result to TypeDTOResponse when it is passed, while at runtime it travels through the middleware pipeline into an executor closure that ignores it and calls bus.execute(processed_dto), so no handler ever sees it.",
