      "statement": "DTOAlreadyRegistered and UnknownDTOToExecute are defined in sincpro_framework/exceptions.py and are not re-exported by the package root, so callers must import that module to catch them; when either reaches the facade's except clause it is reported to observability with kind=\"framework\".",
